{"surah":93,"ayahs":["وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>ضُّحَىٰ","وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّيْلِ إِذَا سَجَىٰ","مَا وَدَّعَكَ رَبُّكَ وَمَا قَلَىٰ","وَلَلْأَخِرَةُ خَيْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">رٌ لَّ</span>كَ مِنَ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأُولَىٰ","وَلَسَوْفَ يُعْطِيكَ رَبُّكَ فَتَرْضَىٰٓ","أَلَمْ يَجِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دْ</span>كَ يَتِي<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">مًا فَ</span>ـَٔـاوَىٰ","وَوَجَدَكَ ضَآل<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">اًّ فَ</span>هَدَىٰ","وَوَجَدَكَ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">عَآ</span>ئِل<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">اً فَ</span>أَغْنَىٰ","فَأَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">مَّ</span>ا <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْيَتِيمَ فَلَا تَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">قْ</span>هَرْ","وَأَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">مَّ</span>ا <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">سَّآ</span>ئِلَ فَلَا تَنْهَرْ","وَأَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">مَّ</span>ا بِنِعْمَةِ رَبِّكَ فَحَدِّثْ"]}